Description: Dashboard widgets for the Keenetic web UI
 Adds a "Сервисы" card to the main page of the Keenetic web interface: status of
 Entware services, links to their web UIs, tabs for telemt, AWG, firc, nfqws,
 Antiscan and the system, with sparkline graphs.
